# Pip Dictée — files that must never be committed.
# Grouped by reason. The pre-commit hook (.githooks/pre-commit) and CI also refuse personal data and secrets, even
# if a rule here is missed. Personal tools are covered too, so contributors don't have to set anything up.

# --- Personal data (it lives in the user's data folder, but never let a copy slip in) ---
history.json
historique.json
dictionary.json
dictionnaire.json
settings.json
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.db
# Recordings
*.wav
*.m4a
*.caf
*.aiff
*.mp3
*.flac
*.ogg

# --- Speech models (1.6 GB; downloaded at setup, checked with SHA-256) ---
models/
*.bin
*.gguf
*.ggml
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.part

# --- Secrets, keys and local config ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
signing.local
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
*.key
*.pem
*.der
*.keystore
*.jks
*.keychain
*.keychain-db
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.snk
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
.netrc
credentials.json
secrets.json

